Acknowledgements
------------------------------------------------------------------------

SplatFPV (https://github.com/Rouf0x/splatfpv, MIT) showed that browser FPV
flight through Gaussian splats is possible. No code from it is included.

Rate curve formulas follow the publicly documented behaviour of Betaflight
and related firmware. They are re-implemented from the formulas; no GPL code
is copied into this repository.

